  "fixes_found_by_consistency": [
    "The crucible source flags its two air cells with air=true but keeps role CASING; the compiled pattern must declare them as AIR instead of copying the role.",
    "Claiming the crucible writes CRUCIBLE_FORMED on its parts through bind; that self-caused write ran outside the incremental probe frame and the projection audit treated it as an external change. applyStructure/releaseStructureClaims now run inside openIncremental."
  ],
